id: pm-vcs-c5pg
title: Switch removes untracked paths absent from the target tree
description: "Installed-CLI stat-cache acceptance exposed that materializeTree deletes every non-ignored working-tree path absent from the target, while switch preflight protects only untracked paths the target would overwrite. A project-local extension registration vanished after switching a repository that had not staged it. This is recoverable in the disposable acceptance but would permanently delete real untracked work."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[5]: data-loss,materialization,multi-agent,switch,untracked
created_at: "2026-08-02T01:01:59.238Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-02T01:12:03.774Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-02T01:07:06.602Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-02T01:07:06.602Z"
claim_principal: "harness:codex#bc0aaeb05b20f232948dc535"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: "Switch, merge, undo and reset remove tracked paths absent from the target but preserve every untracked path; an untracked path colliding with a target still refuses before mutation; real repository tests cover nested files and installed project configuration; full coverage remains 100/100/100"
parent: pm-vcs-tr2a
risk: critical
severity: critical
resolution: Tracked ownership is explicit at the materialization boundary; untracked files are preserved.
expected_result: Materialization removes only paths owned by the current index and never deletes untracked data.
actual_result: Nested untracked files and project-local extension registration survive switch; collision refusal remains covered.
component: engine/repo
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-02T01:07:05.827Z","harness:codex","The installed-CLI reproducer initially lost the project-local pm-vcs extension after switch. Materialization now receives the current index path set and deletes only paths owned by that index; nested untracked files survive, tracked branch-only files still disappear, and target collisions remain preflight refusals. The installed extension stays active after the real switch and the full 384-test 100/100/100 gate passes."
  "2026-08-02T01:12:03.758Z","harness:codex",The installed-CLI acceptance now also proves project-local untracked extension registration survives branch materialization. The authoritative suite remains 384/384 with exact 100 percent coverage; publication remains separately blocked by pm-vcs-mhbz.
files[4]{path,scope,note}:
  engine/repo.ts,project,supply current tracked ownership during materialization
  engine/worktree.ts,project,restrict removal to index-owned paths
  scripts/accept-stat-cache.ts,project,real installed extension remains usable after switch
  test/repo.test.ts,project,preserve nested untracked content across switch
tests[2]{command,scope,timeout_seconds,note}:
  "npm run accept:stat-cache",project,240,installed project extension survives untracked switch
  npm run coverage,project,2400,all materialization paths covered at exact 100 percent
close_reason: Materialization now removes only index-owned paths and preserves untracked project data across every shared materialization path.
